    "message": "Reduce PNR tree storage and filter direct-click precision by decision intervals\n\nReplay all32768 frozen PNR records with binary-order-preserving block leaves. Validate scalar and same-Gram decision intervals, replay all512 frozen direct-click records, and generate preregistered fresh512 B64 and512 B128 records under one31-event nominal99 confidence family. Preserve the failed midpoint validation and quantify serial timing, storage and approximation bias.\n\nValidation: 268333 final independent checks; 1019 tests run, 990 successful, zero failures/errors; eight new tests. Full-law quality and general superiority remain open research work.",
